POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "SAVINGS",
  "balance": 1200.50
}

### Get account by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/accounts/999
Accept: application/json
### Update account
PUT http://localhost:8080/accounts/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "SAVINGS",
  "balance": 9500.00
}

### Update account that doesn't exist
PUT http://localhost:8080/accounts/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "SAVINGS",
  "balance": 9500.00
}

### Delete account
DELETE http://localhost:8080/accounts/4